      "CHILDREN LIST LIKELY MISATTRIBUTED (research 2026-07-03): the tree lists all 8 of Joseph Hibbard's children (including Joseph Hibbard III, I182541965880) as children of this marriage (1775), but per Genealogy of the Hibbard Family (1901), entry #163, every one of those children's birth years (1783-1799) falls after Joseph's second marriage, to Anna Dugan, in 1780 — i.e., after this wife's own marriage year. These children more likely belong to the Anna Dugan marriage; no children of the Mary Lyons union are identified in the published genealogy."
